    },
    {
      q: 'How do I do HRV breathing?',
      a: "Breathe slowly and evenly, about 5.5 seconds in and 5.5 seconds out, with no holds, for a few minutes. That's coherent breathing at roughly 5.5 breaths per minute, the rhythm HRV biofeedback uses. Refresher paces it and lets you move the pace if yours sits elsewhere.",
