      a: 'Resonant breathing and coherent breathing are the same pace: about 5.5 breaths a minute, where Lehrer and Gevirtz put the average resonance frequency. Refresher paces it at 5.5 s in and out by default, and the slider runs 3 to 10 s in half-second steps if your own frequency sits elsewhere.',
